		{
			dependencies: ["7E903DF0431EA6E6"]
			description: ["  As you go deeper into &l&#D2691EThe Cursed   Pyramid&r&r, you start to see &#D2691Esuspicious  sand&r here and there. If you &#D2691Ebrush&r      the suspicious sand, you have a          chance to get a &l&#D2691Edesert necklace&r&r.     &#D2691E&lThe Necklace of the Desert&r&r is      required to awaken &l&#D2691EThe Ancient       Remnant&r&r."]
